{
  "source": "data/basic_electricity/source/Basic electricity/基本電學-題庫系統-108課綱-上學期.docx",
  "parts": [
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      題目編號",
      "text_sha256": "e4d7d2f3a7a87e779cf69a59ce0d1bbe0d004f2d444852fb15edff7cc1955af7"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "題目",
      "text_sha256": "f22631d0799b4f876549a90371fdb69f2ca2df6c554f09d13935ada2dfdc7309"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "第一章節",
      "text_sha256": "bf5b9141af2dc4170be86993f34c1524d2295e3a1d79846fdba777b59a36e3b2"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "001",
      "text_sha256": "a3feaa646c54c2326763b52932b8dca80a69cf44bb81d7293e4f1c913a54f77d"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "text": "設有一電荷載有2.5×10-16個電子，則該電荷帶有多少庫侖的電量?",
      "text_sha256": "abcc91fec0c5ca12631c3cebe16faa2dc49b61041fb2c7c58656371efca8a703"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 7,
      "text": "(A)4              (B)4×10-3        (C)1.6×10-3          (D)2.5×1016",
      "text_sha256": "a2cd31bcf3ada4240bbd1884448f70568ccd8014a91e937124650d6ab5036741"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 8,
      "text": "002",
      "text_sha256": "f3f2837c2b6669057a26306e8098ee05a18044658898e07528da159fd9a0f57f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 9,
      "text": "每1秒鐘流過1庫侖的電量，稱為?",
      "text_sha256": "04003b42ff3a908a30e050bc0c1212cf15a4a61ff3593413b7fac0640aebd2be"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 10,
      "text": "(A)1A             (B)1C           (C)1W              (D)1V",
      "text_sha256": "cb470f5dd85a81a36bd29b9e3df4c17ce5d16c07bfd4a6bca0d33e391672f1a0"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 11,
      "text": "003",
      "text_sha256": "03b9fa4b773610c8a60262936d75446af0919271a730a90a5ea1d461130d3f42"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 12,
      "text": "若電池的充電電流為2A且連續充電2小時，則充電的總電荷輛為多少庫侖?",
      "text_sha256": "4642c980974f168d0605938fca5cf7a5e988f489d6a53e320654fd7cb53cb76f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 13,
      "text": "(A)40×10-3         (B)36×103       (C)14.4×103         (D)4×103",
      "text_sha256": "04b50d2c0cf0b7bb0fbb4e8e7c4c04e2fd4eaa3ca55cf02bc40ea32c64b5b29f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 14,
      "text": "004",
      "text_sha256": "df2ed63dd071cb3a6d47c8962f019d030c91e17406d9e57225da408ae7195c12"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 15,
      "text": "根據近代原子理論，每層電子軌道可劃分為s、p、d、f四個副層，其中f層具有電子數為?",
      "text_sha256": "b38973767c326e2f7d5fb45e97e21b04ec0ca73634db80ae52fd1b8c82958bfe"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 16,
      "text": "(A)14             (B)10            (C)8               (D)2",
      "text_sha256": "11a9bf552d6cd44fae7e6a4d788592f4cfd0e5a624305d7f8596b9b40e012ab4"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 17,
      "text": "005",
      "text_sha256": "da9e3f29ca761cb114f7f30b68936519d99f52e73d5f3058bb545fec41c9bfda"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 18,
      "text": "下列有關電的敘述，何者錯誤?",
      "text_sha256": "a52e9a7666daae314e0c5732777e620b07dbe1cefdff982fdad7acca18c51f26"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 19,
      "text": "(A)使電荷移動而作功之動力稱為電動勢",
      "text_sha256": "7b675aee9c9dbaf707fb490316b171fdfc93573f6ccce2c7852a3e48327ba096"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 20,
      "text": "(B)導體中電子流動的方向就是傳統電流的反方向",
      "text_sha256": "a0b09efe42c29a5c59c278dab7e1c8499959f4240f48d85349e3f85199cca37c"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 21,
      "text": "(C)1度電相當於1千瓦之電功率",
      "text_sha256": "1acc6fe310c5259513c3c2bb4ad9b67cdfaa3792f0c7de39af0dd44d02cbbc09"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 22,
      "text": "(D)同性電荷相斥，異性電荷相吸",
      "text_sha256": "238ed6236ecac5fdd25477a1b6abac00e19bb7b5cb244a184d917f5d14439d07"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 23,
      "text": "006",
      "text_sha256": "6fdef0cb390f1aec9d6c3a25dad925e1637e1956f2b9772986a2493ec0d717a6"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "有一電容器的電容值為10nF，其中英文字母n代表的數值為何?",
      "text_sha256": "be5602ef1090daabedf609f5b55c149e18f48344a19c8c64bd0eca3c20c99181"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 25,
      "text": "(A)10-3            (B)10-6           (C)10-9              (D)10-12",
      "text_sha256": "8c137c8a7ffa86d8063131219c1128c245fc117c3623896506bff39499b4908f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 26,
      "text": "007",
      "text_sha256": "82c4f652a2eaf8aaa4bcb2f37f7342e0aa00d12d2836eaf2c443e928662d0a37"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 27,
      "text": "某一110V馬達驅動機械負載，若轉速穩定於2800rpm，輸出功率為1hp，且消耗電流為9A，此時該馬達的效率最接近下列何者?",
      "text_sha256": "65b6dd0ee7d85d7bf7b75d2f9913dee6b9981b8ae5d36d6969f26c3c368707c0"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 28,
      "text": "(A)90%           (B)85%            (C)80%             (D)75%",
      "text_sha256": "878962a5e608d48d06010162c70db248ddd8ae71fafdd829b3c65c01d4a77a6a"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 29,
      "text": "008",
      "text_sha256": "34d874f8335acfe86c2576e9f86694127c772339e431407e5d55c065615f3696"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 30,
      "text": "將2庫倫的正電荷從電位20V處移至110V處，需花費10秒的時間，則其平均功率大小為多少W?",
      "text_sha256": "09d8938891b421620172e5779ff82f4c925e4bfedb41b5d730baf0ec6b2b33d4"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 31,
      "text": "(A)32             (B)20             (C)18              (D)16",
      "text_sha256": "1810c3325e27ecc357b8157b0aad93e0977e140c7f318978b2a391bec9e4f9ff"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 32,
      "text": "009",
      "text_sha256": "7df0bac8ce10fd707f76c17dd4f54bc55a9e93a851c18f51af103109693e1838"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 33,
      "text": "有一帶3庫侖之正電荷由A點移至B點，若B點電位為100伏特，A點電位為20伏特，試求移動該正電荷需作功多少",
      "text_sha256": "005cbb919dac3f5092d3553f75cd282aa54f129892dd65954f5715550733b563"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 34,
      "text": "(A)20焦耳        (B)150焦耳        (C)240焦耳         (D)360焦耳",
      "text_sha256": "a9984debca47949042e7030c9c8926de942278facce568945eb4f294b1cb1c16"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 35,
      "text": "010",
      "text_sha256": "262a18dc9ba922c6ecf7d6fa005cf985e73db824cfc9208d4278611c1cc32396"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 36,
      "text": "某電池的電位差5V，供電作功20焦耳，則總共有多少電子從負極流向正極?",
      "text_sha256": "4247c7b4f6776b4e3af2308768025f56e3b77f39fe29d9f94be9e6358e322e88"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 37,
      "text": "(A)4             (B)100             (C)6.25×1018        (D)2.5×1019",
      "text_sha256": "5673ee0975bb7feede2ccac86dd7e09383be170576aea7b326dda57329bf19fa"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 38,
      "text": "011",
      "text_sha256": "a9ea89a4b1dd56a0a209288885c004998499e7aab409539b5bc2709b85ca37a3"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 39,
      "text": "有一家用110伏特、100瓦特的燈泡，接於110伏特的交流電源，求流過燈泡的電流為多少mA?",
      "text_sha256": "304a4ce9dd8366dd2a30e83a708e3070d8093f53bba3381347abafc8d8af1534"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 40,
      "text": "(A)100            (B)545            (C)909               (D)6600",
      "text_sha256": "b1a06a78cff8392c058a07953e82e13262866f71ac2a4a23c1addd7e140cb276"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 41,
      "text": "012",
      "text_sha256": "6f01767959419e6534c08104dcc7b1b7ab0a4faedf21cef817a3b9fc6f7b643b"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 42,
      "text": "有一用戶的瓦時表，其電表常數為1000Rev/kWh，若觀察此表每5秒轉動1圈，則此時用戶的負載為多少瓦特?",
      "text_sha256": "de7c1627e5a70c36db4cbdc82d2084f04c0e42549323a460787c072adc11be63"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 43,
      "text": "(A)480            (B)600             (C)720              (D)1000",
      "text_sha256": "6c48a1c87590ee077742dc1290bf287f47aee02925042aa5c649a3cb9155ff9b"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 44,
      "text": "013",
      "text_sha256": "995bb3b0013cfbc4879688b97c0523a8ddeeb0e8109cfdcd31b2594d43831f2c"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 45,
      "text": "一步電腦消耗的平均功率為250W，連續使用8消蝕，共消耗多少度電?",
      "text_sha256": "2343152a73e3da12d32e24fb3b182ab122a384377949601e5d6476c6c9f26771"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 46,
      "text": "(A)8度             (B)6度           (C)4度              (D)2度",
      "text_sha256": "20fb7c7bf87d4c3cc7efb1f17748341cee85b9df2c6eb397424a7785afbad0df"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 47,
      "text": "014",
      "text_sha256": "a0d51fa08b06c7ca203d8f20c45c87b23e33ab11013f912a4a0eab6037b4b55e"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 48,
      "text": "將正電荷由低電位移向至高電位，所作的功稱為",
      "text_sha256": "c775c5c7b2f71822678f80f16c425f10a6ba7258c86cdb023cf45811d042a875"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 49,
      "text": "(A)正功           (B)負功            (C)不一定           (D)不作功",
      "text_sha256": "5f7d5c0d6cfee5bc36d3013553fe7fb12101872559540aba54a386bac7507b61"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 50,
      "text": "015",
      "text_sha256": "e6a178c0829d9454edf2a957da734a790fdbd375079d4ad06134d82988e9cb1c"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 51,
      "text": "用來將電能轉變成機械能的機器為何?",
      "text_sha256": "6dfbd10a16c7ed397bb6ffda7faee23f20d3e284b7b5d1f003d8e417c09a2514"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 52,
      "text": "(A)電動機         (B)發電機          (C)電暖器           (D)喇叭",
      "text_sha256": "2db8b16a2ef1d7e751b79887e39a7c1c11ae4e86c3af11ba2d6add4cd9369d84"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 53,
      "text": "016",
      "text_sha256": "eab4ba79c2513066b40405cc0fb78e570d24f70fc78990b7e495a95db3e93570"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 54,
      "text": "將4庫侖的正電荷移至B點，需作功12焦耳，則A與B兩點間的電位差為多少伏特?",
      "text_sha256": "c6eb877ebe823e425c1b2c33d4b2e1604c42eb7a42579465c42f7d07a976828c"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 55,
      "text": "(A)-3             (B)3               (C)48               (D)-48",
      "text_sha256": "326d5feedf155347d4ddcb63980eb9ce4cda472f473231d50c071243de0eac6e"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 56,
      "text": "017",
      "text_sha256": "fc6317f0330e0592706dd3060a8dc624f05a0cbcc54fec4887d6b0c95eef169d"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 57,
      "text": "5hp的抽水機，使用20分鐘，設其效率為90%，則共消耗多少仟焦耳的電能?",
      "text_sha256": "2abd01cb1e6d416ba691569b2f075bdb3a589ea89516feec1e580560ebb3a7e2"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 58,
      "text": "(A)2238           (B)4476           (C)4973              (D)8952",
      "text_sha256": "505eac44f100446462d0accc571e32f102f2af4bb58589f06b84b5692b59b59e"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 59,
      "text": "018",
      "text_sha256": "5807e7963c133f92b062bdb798d535a1761902cc2d81fbddd1de4429eff956b0"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 60,
      "text": "將0.05C的正電荷由b點移到a點，需要作正功400mJ，則a、b兩點間的電位差Vab為多少V?",
      "text_sha256": "3d113b9329d2406924b0f46a10180bd81ad106e6047b179020d2a23b03978f5a"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 61,
      "text": "(A)8              (B)20m            (C)-20m             (D)-8",
      "text_sha256": "16c1bc23e51202e90e10b73a288140f280df4df06d399fcdc2bc1336ebcf64d3"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 62,
      "text": "019",
      "text_sha256": "20e5cef74fdade91dfbfe774a8458c25b3f4bc35ebc6a728aed6bde90b73af12"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 63,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 64,
      "text": "020",
      "text_sha256": "d2403dbbf9f29f167d5e8b0f88b33a3c9b43ab8e8e52484924b51143abe93eb8"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 65,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 66,
      "text": "021",
      "text_sha256": "f9275c65a828cfb9a0159ea3e767f016588617832362966ef8c094a5f4cac1db"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 67,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 68,
      "text": "022",
      "text_sha256": "87b7f7d42e11909abffdf63f1ec000b3da8bdcbec0aa3d89d2e99dd9687d220f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 69,
      "text": "若15瓦特的省電燈泡與10瓦特LED燈有相同的亮度。某一家庭原共有10支15瓦特的省電燈泡，希望在相同的亮度下全部以LED燈來替代，該家庭每天固定點燈8小時，且10支燈泡均同時動作，若使用30天可節省幾度電?",
      "text_sha256": "aef065105a3b29245a095dd8cc0af2e94291dcd79f6820c825b09db557fecc30"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 70,
      "text": "(A)12               (B)15                   (C)18             (D)21",
      "text_sha256": "e85cd0da6e1d035c911066b50f1c1fa09aa55ba67f10dbd63c82f93ad179715c"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 71,
      "text": "023",
      "text_sha256": "01f62e6c19c324cbfa92cb68dc81f32b1fa78c5cd69d715d9ac228aeda429d26"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 72,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 73,
      "text": "024",
      "text_sha256": "c7d71199cf84e46af01eb83e9b6c1947e261419ac01edf260c4b18fc8b041a28"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 74,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 75,
      "text": "025",
      "text_sha256": "f8f9539ff6bdcd03e5452c0411c4d2ea984400f17ec46c5e1ca21cce4d80c562"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 76,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 77,
      "text": "026",
      "text_sha256": "5887dde9c29c4b7805e2cb5693351694e7872260802aaa3c4033762ea8854a55"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 78,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 79,
      "text": "027",
      "text_sha256": "c40b4c5c584dc5b165d20b606eb63a140428ae89a4334e284736528e6a3bb4ab"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 80,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 81,
      "text": "028",
      "text_sha256": "168207088bd2c07debcc315a3fa83e213fc93c1ae6a9535318e58bb0d06d980e"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 82,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 83,
      "text": "029",
      "text_sha256": "9b51258d7ebff8179520c4fb17e99e1b3a817435d5afdd7c4b99a6f46f48d5d4"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 84,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 85,
      "text": "030",
      "text_sha256": "458bb8d016ff118e564384811e72363f1f745cb3457873f5788462ce0f0c4d49"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 86,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 87,
      "text": "031",
      "text_sha256": "3697da4876ed53fa7413585510184e0ce2f6881322fbf269d0a298ab2227a6ba"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 88,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
